package org.autojs.autojs.rhino

/**
 * Rhino name aliases for the former `com.stardust` compatibility package (roadmap P7.3, decision D18, scheme 3).
 *
 * The frozen copies of the Auto.js 4 classes were removed from the host on 2026-10-13. A script that names one of
 * the classes below (`importClass(com.stardust.pio.PFile)`, `new com.stardust...(...)`, `x instanceof com.stardust...`,
 * `Packages.com.stardust...`) receives the AutoJs6 class instead. Two tiers:
 *
 * - [TABLE]: the host class covers every member a script could reach through the name (static members, the
 *   constructors a script could call and, for constructible or extensible types, the instance members). The
 *   recorded API of the removed copies lives in `app/src/test/resources/stardust-alias-snapshot.json` and
 *   `StardustClassAliasesTest` checks every entry against the host class, so a host change that drops such a member
 *   fails the unit tests instead of failing silently in a script.
 * - [BEST_EFFORT]: the host class of the same name (or the renamed utility named in the comment) covers most of the
 *   copy's API but not all of it; the known gaps are listed in `docs/dev/stardust-compat-inventory.md`. The copy is
 *   gone, so a partial alias is strictly better than an unresolvable name, and `instanceof` against host objects
 *   finally works for core classes such as `UiObject` or `ScriptRuntime`.
 *
 * The tables are consulted only by [AndroidClassLoader.loadClass], and only when the lookup was issued by Rhino
 * itself; the VM and `java.lang.Class.forName` keep receiving the class they asked for.
 *
 * zh-CN: 原 `com.stardust` 兼容包在 Rhino 中的类名别名 (roadmap P7.3, 决策 D18, 方案 3). Auto.js 4 类的冻结副本已于 2026-10-13
 * 从宿主移除; 脚本以下列名字引用类时拿到 AutoJs6 的实现. 两层: [TABLE] 中宿主类覆盖了脚本能通过类名触及的全部成员
 * (副本的 API 记录在 `app/src/test/resources/stardust-alias-snapshot.json`, 由 `StardustClassAliasesTest` 逐项核对宿主类);
 * [BEST_EFFORT] 中同名 (或注释中注明的改名) 宿主类覆盖了大部分而非全部成员, 已知缺口列在 `docs/dev/stardust-compat-inventory.md`,
 * 副本既已移除, 部分别名仍优于无法解析的名字, 且 `UiObject`, `ScriptRuntime` 等核心类对宿主对象的 `instanceof` 终于成立.
 * 两张表只由 [AndroidClassLoader.loadClass] 在查找由 Rhino 自身发起时查询; VM 与 `java.lang.Class.forName` 仍拿到所请求的类.
 */
object StardustClassAliases {

